# Resident lease upload — never blank AI-review account

**Symptom:** After uploading a lease on **Edit Resident → Save**, the UI shows **Enter your name.** (or Fast Track Continue fails with that message).

**Cause:** Writing `emptyExtractionReview()` / blank `formDraft.extractionReview.account.contactName` into `landlord_onboarding` draft or `ulo.landlordOnboarding.*` localStorage. `validateReviewManualAccount` then returns `Enter your name.`

## Rule

| Action | Required |
|---|---|
| Persist profile lease files | Use `draft_state.residentLeaseDocuments` + `ulo.residentLeaseDocs.{landlordId}` only |
| Matching on profile / Settings | Prefer `extractedPayload` on the file; do not invent an AI review |
| Heal leftover stubs | Strip blank-account review stubs (empty portfolio or profile-only `ext-lease-*-0` rows) |
| Fast Track Continue | Seed `contactName` from `accountSetup` / `landlords.contact_name` before `validateReviewManualAccount` |

## Autofix (Bugbot)

On PR review (or when this symptom appears in chat), if lease upload or related draft code can recreate a blank AI-review account:

1. Stop calling `emptyExtractionReview()` / writing `formDraft.extractionReview` from Edit Resident lease save.
2. Persist uploads under `residentLeaseDocuments` (draft + dedicated localStorage key) — **not** by merging into Fast Track `formDraft.uploadDocuments` in a way that rewrites extraction review.
3. Do **not** rewrite all of `ulo.landlordOnboarding.{id}` from lease upload (that can wipe `onboardingStatus` / `accountSetup`). Only delete a blank `formDraft.extractionReview` stub in place.
4. Ensure `commitFastTrackImport` / Continue still fills blank `contactName` from landlord profile before validating.
5. Keep `Enter your name.` only on account-setup / AI-review Continue — never throw it from `uploadResidentLeaseDocuments`.

**Note:** Cursor Bugbot runs on pull requests. It does not auto-run while debugging locally — agents must apply this rule when the symptom appears in chat or PR.

## Where it lives

- Upload + heal: `src/lib/residentLeaseDocuments.ts` → `uploadResidentLeaseDocuments`
- Archive load (ignore stubs): `src/lib/organizationSettings.ts` → `loadOnboardingDocumentArchive`
- Continue validation: `src/lib/onboarding/fastTrackImport.ts` + `validateReviewManualAccount`
- Error string sources: `onboardingAccountForm.ts`, `onboardingReviewManual.ts`

## Do not

- Call `emptyExtractionReview()` from profile lease upload
- Spread-write local onboarding state with only `{ formDraft }` (drops completed status)
- Rely on inventing `extractionReview` leases for profile document matching
